message: "If you use this software, please cite the article listed below."
title: "BCM-UNet: Boundary-Guided Crack Segmentation and Quantification for Coal CT Images"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of BCM-UNet, a boundary-guided multi-scale U-Net for
  segmenting fractures in coal CT images, together with a skeleton-based
  fracture quantification pipeline and the CrackQuant desktop application.
type: software
